irst time listening and you appreciate what you hear, consider becoming a listener-supporter of Between The Covers. Every supporter receives emails with each episode pointing to lectures, films, interviews, and books referenced in each conversation, as well as suggestions of further places to explore. Every supporter plays a big role in helping shape who we invite in the future as guests. But there are also a lot of other potential benefits and rewards. Some offered by past guests and others by Tin House. Rare collectibles, the"
